OL,3,GNEWSAPM agrees to talks on stalled A&E
OL,4,Aplans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has said he will
OL,7,Fattend talks over a long-promised but
OL,8,Fstill undelivered accident and
OL,9,Femergency department extension.
OL,11,FPlanning permission for the #30m work
OL,12,Fat University Hospital North Durham was
OL,13,Fapproved in 2017, but cost estimates
OL,14,Frose to between #60m and #80m for an
OL,15,Fupdated scheme approved in January
OL,16,F2023.
OL,18,FRaising the issue at Prime Minister's
OL,19,FQuestions, Durham MP Mary Kelly Foy
OL,20,Fsaid County Durham and Darlington Trust
OL,21,Fcould no longer fund the scheme.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
